# Top-level Lambda runtime deps — human-edited source.
# boto3 is bundled deliberately: relying on the Lambda runtime SDK skews its
# botocore against our packaged urllib3 (pulled in by requests). Keep it pinned
# together in requirements.txt instead.
#
# After editing this file, regenerate the pinned requirements.txt:
#   uv pip compile src/requirements.in --python-platform aarch64-manylinux2014 \
#     --python-version 3.12 --no-header --no-annotate -o src/requirements.txt
